Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.58,Note,,0,0,0,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.04,0:00:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed和Harry\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed and Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,打鬼特工队\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ghostfacers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.75,0:00:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在这儿干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.39,0:00:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就属于这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We belong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.22,0:00:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是专业人士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're professionals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.84,0:00:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,什么专业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professional what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,超自然现象调查员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paranormal investigators.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.73,0:00:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This stuff right here,this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,能领我们走向辉煌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is our ticket to the big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.01,0:00:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,名利 金钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fame,money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.94,0:00:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,性欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,大把的美妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}With girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.68,0:00:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.53,0:00:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.91,0:00:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,发生的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}That has ever gone wrong between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.81,0:00:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,都是因为 我们是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has been because we're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.65,0:00:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 我们现在就不是了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what?We're not family now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.14,0:00:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 你想干活的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying you wanna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.40,0:00:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.44,0:00:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说你想让所有事都\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you wanted to keep things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 公事化 - 我想让我们之间的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Strictly business - I wanna keep things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.65,0:00:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,从此以后 公事化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strictly business between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你那天说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what you said the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.94,0:00:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你没意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that wouldn't bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.14,0:00:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我想事情可能没有那么周全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may not think things all the way through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.72,0:00:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.58,0:00:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,都是因为它们是正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do because it's the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.39,0:00:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你并不是为了我才救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't save me,for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你是为了你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it, for you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:51.01,Note,,0,0,0,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.24,0:00:58.18,Note,,0,0,0,,(斯普林代尔 华盛顿州)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.87,0:01:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.49,0:01:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,妈 你回来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom,are you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.84,0:02:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,911 请问您有什么紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}911,what is your emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.58,0:02:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在我的房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's someone in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.41,0:02:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,请问您住在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your location.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.62,0:02:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,您能给我们提供一个地址吗 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you give us a location,ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.38,0:02:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,您还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.78,0:02:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.55,0:02:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要挂断电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please do not hang up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.05,0:02:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在追踪您的电话来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've begun tracing your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.21,0:02:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我需要您保持通话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need you to stay on the line for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.94,0:02:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我出去一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.75,0:02:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你 你去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...Where're you heading.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.94,0:02:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,华盛顿州 发现一个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Washington,I caught a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.13,0:02:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想让我跟去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to come with.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.17,0:02:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你会去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna come.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.79,0:02:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,去查案子吗 为什么不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a hunt?Why wouldn't I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.19,0:03:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我也说不好 因为最近你总是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know,man.'Cause lately with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.49,0:03:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,阴晴不定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up is down and down is...sideways,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.54,0:03:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么知道你想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.08,0:03:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你想来就来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,you want in,fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.09,0:03:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这是从案发现场泄露的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Photo leaked from crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.81,0:03:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,一个女孩被杀死在房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl was murdered in a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.04,0:03:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,门窗都从里面反锁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door was locked.Windows were locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.73,0:03:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,后面那个疤脸是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was the wallflower.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.63,0:03:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.33,0:03:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,目前来看 应该是个鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best guess.Ghost caught on the film.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.18,0:03:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 你是要跟来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.45,0:03:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我像是要留在这里的样子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it look like I'm staying
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.30,0:03:54.82,Note,,0,0,0,,(斯普林代尔 华盛顿州)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.61,0:03:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我擦了好几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I scrubbed for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.74,0:03:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,整条地毯都浸透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have to rip up the carpet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.41,0:04:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我女儿 Cassy\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter,Cassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,她自己挑的颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}She picked up the color herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.86,0:04:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,请您 节哀顺变 Smiles太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're...very sorry for your loss,Mrs.Miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.80,0:04:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,您之前说 Cassy没有 敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mentioned Cassy had no known enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.33,0:04:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那在家里有没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about...at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,什么异常的现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything...unusual you may have noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,比如电流异常 或者灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like electricity acting out or lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.31,0:04:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,闪烁不定 电视信号时有时无\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flickering?TV on the fritz.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.42,0:04:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不 家里电视信号很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no fritzing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.84,0:04:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有气温骤降区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}No cold spots either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.49,0:04:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我就是好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry,out of curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.77,0:04:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,您为什么要提气温骤降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you mention cold spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.64,0:04:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 听起来可能很奇怪 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry that might sounds strange,but.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.10,0:04:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,已经过去3天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been 3 days since.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,警察什么也没查到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police have found nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.95,0:04:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我就 我就卖了房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have...I'd have to sell my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.94,0:04:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,雇了一个私人调查员\N{\fnArial\fs30}To afford a private investigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.85,0:04:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,所以当超自然现象专家致电给我的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when the supernaturalists called.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.22,0:04:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry,the.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.74,0:04:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,您是说超自然现象专家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supernaturalists.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.23,0:04:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道FBI肯定不相信这种怪事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know to the FBI is not exactly orthodox.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.71,0:05:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这些人知道很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}But these men had answers that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.43,0:05:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,别人不知道的事 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one else had and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.01,0:05:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我欠Cassy的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe it,to Cassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.94,0:05:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,都怪我没听她的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}To listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.74,0:05:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他们既然提起了气温骤降点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,they brought up cold spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.45,0:05:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是跟什么有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}In relation to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.02,0:05:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜是什么超自然征兆吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signs of the paranormal,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.35,0:05:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他们今天会过来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are coming by today to take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.41,0:05:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,请问这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am,did these.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.93,0:05:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,超自然学专家有没有告诉你他们的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supernaturalists give you a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.91,0:05:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,狗娘养的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.49,0:05:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,猜我发现了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,whoa,look we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.36,0:05:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,又多了两个粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two more followers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.16,0:05:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry 是我们在图书馆做采访的那两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry,it's from the library interview we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.97,0:05:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.85,0:05:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Dana又发什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did Dana post.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.99,0:05:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 就是她换了她资料里的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,it's just she changed her profile pic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.04,0:05:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,明显能看出来 是被裁过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's cropped but you can clearly see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.43,0:05:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,肩膀还被一个男的搂着\N{\fnArial\fs30}A guy's arm around her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,她笑的花枝乱颤 跟小妖精似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she's smiling like the dickens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:06:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 可能 是柏拉图式的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,it...it could be a platonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.36,0:06:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说那个搂着的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arm that's touching her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.31,0:06:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Winchester兄弟 真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesters,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.69,0:06:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不可能会有人 - 这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Says nobody - Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.23,0:06:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,闭上嘴听我说事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,shut up and listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.01,0:06:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来是这样发展的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how it's gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.95,0:06:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个丢人现眼的 立刻回你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two clowns are gonna get into.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.14,0:06:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,停在外面的神秘机器里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That mystery machine outside and.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.29,0:06:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,然后离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are gonna leave the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.15,0:06:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我会在你们膝盖上开两个洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I'm gonna put holes in your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.15,0:06:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,请问你们要点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get you guys anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.30,0:06:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.48,0:06:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们准备好买单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ready for the bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.42,0:06:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这盘子没洗干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are still crud on this plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.29,0:06:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,去水槽那里重新洗一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit the sink and do it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.33,0:06:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 Trey\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry,Trey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.45,0:06:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}First of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.99,0:06:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你们吓不倒我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys don't scare us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,完全吓不倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.43,0:06:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,来和我的小手枪问个好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hola to my little pistola.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.47,0:06:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我是应该被你的腹毛吓到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I supposed to be impressed by that treasure trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.18,0:06:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,还是被你塞在裤子里的女士小手枪吓到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the lady gun you got hide in your pants there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.04,0:06:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.21,0:06:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你们喜不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,whether you like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.48,0:06:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经控制好局势了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're handling this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.73,0:06:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.67,0:06:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我只看见两个为了虚荣不择手段的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Casue I see a couple of fame whores.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.12,0:07:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,把目标对准了一个刚失去孩子的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are pointing their camera on a mom who just lost her kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.18,0:07:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是调查员\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are investigators.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们有权 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have every right - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.51,0:07:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你们没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,知道为什么吗 因为你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to why?'Cause you're just.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.12,0:07:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,只会给我们添麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna get in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.14,0:07:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,或者让更多的人被害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you're gonna get somebody else killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.75,0:07:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,对 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right,so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.86,0:07:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要么走出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can either walk out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.25,0:07:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,要么爬出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or crawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.33,0:07:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,自己决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.20,0:07:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天 放松点儿好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god manudo,will you guys relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.59,0:07:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道我们在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know what we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.81,0:07:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yup - Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.42,0:07:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那你们队里其他人都去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what about the rest of the Bad News Bears.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.43,0:07:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得 我记得有个胖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the...where's the fat one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.99,0:07:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,还有个女孩儿 是还有个女孩儿对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the girl,there's a girl,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.27,0:07:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他们背 我们放弃了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They...we dropped them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.70,0:07:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他们 拖了我们后腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're...they were dead-weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.87,0:07:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,they are still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.94,0:07:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对都还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are...they're totally alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.11,0:07:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see,so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,掺和这事儿的就只有你们两个蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just...the dumpy duo then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.76,0:07:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那太好了 事实是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,that's great.So here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.06,0:07:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,一个鬼能5秒内放倒你们两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ghost,will land you two dead in 5 seconds flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.30,0:07:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他们以为是鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,they think it's a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,根本不是鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so not a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.95,0:07:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,we'll bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.19,0:07:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你们觉得是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.80,0:07:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我 能让我来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I...Can I do it this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.99,0:07:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你来 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got it - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.04,0:07:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经等这一刻很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've waited all my life for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.57,0:08:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就不告诉你们 贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazon me,bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.17,0:08:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的会 一枪崩了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will,shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.58,0:08:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.35,0:08:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like we're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.10,0:08:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是要走吧 对吧 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just going.Right?Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.23,0:08:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,聊得真愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.10,0:08:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这俩人真是 营养过剩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty shades of...way too much protein.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.51,0:08:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.06,0:08:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed和Harry写了本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed and Harry wrote a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.98,0:08:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.39,0:08:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,末影人大揭秘\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Skinny on Thinman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.59,0:08:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,美国著名超自然学专家著\N{\fnArial\fs30}By America's foremost supernaturalists.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.33,0:08:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,末影人是什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is a Thinman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.03,0:08:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.57,0:08:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check that out though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.84,0:08:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,貌似还真像\N{\fnArial\fs30}That...does kinda look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.60,0:08:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cassy Smiles背后的那个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever was behind Cassy Miles,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.83,0:08:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么不说像Garth 脸被削掉的版本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Garth if somebody shaved his face off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.52,0:08:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真可怕 - 这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Big Whoop - Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.28,0:08:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,末影人 最初源于某网站的都市传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thinman,an urban legend started on a world wide web.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.23,0:09:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他们潜伏在被害人的背影里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lurks in the background of his victims' lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.21,0:09:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好后就杀死被害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until he's ready to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.86,0:09:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,说得对 因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,because.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.70,0:09:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,所有从网上传出来的东西都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything started on the Internet is...true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.81,0:09:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,比如 一条鲨鱼攻击了一架直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like...a shark attacking the helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.28,0:09:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是不是也写了本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}They write a book on that one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.92,0:09:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄 不管是否真实 成千上万的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude,real or not,thousands of people have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.65,0:09:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,都在这个网上留过言 就好像末影人是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Posted this site.It's like this Thinman is like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.08,0:09:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,大脚怪一样的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new bigfoot or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.46,0:09:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,或者末影人只是鬼的新名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Thinman is just a ghost with a brand name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么说是因为你觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saying that cause you really think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.68,0:09:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是鬼 还是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a ghost or because you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.18,0:09:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你不喜欢打鬼特工队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't like the Ghostfacers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.65,0:09:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了EMF在Cassy房间里的度数有多惊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget we hit EMF in Cassy's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是 但是那房子旁边挨着电缆线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right,but the house was next door to power lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.39,0:09:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能影响读数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which can effect read.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.62,0:09:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,一个女孩儿死在封闭的房间里 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}A girl died in a locked room,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.82,0:09:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,明显就是鬼干的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spells ghost right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,也可能是没锁之前溜进去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it got in there before it was locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.05,0:09:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道呢 Dean 但是全世界的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows,Dean.But how could people all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.73,0:09:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,都看到同一个鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world see the same ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.90,0:09:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼不能到处乱跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spirits don't exactly hop around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.32,0:09:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但是现在 阴阳交界处出问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But right now the veil's all kinds of screwed,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼爱怎么跑就怎么跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ghost can popping up anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是 但是末影人几年前就出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,Dean.But Thinman sightings date back a couple of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.51,0:09:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,交界是什么时候出问题的来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The veil's only been a problem for like what.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.87,0:09:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,6个月前而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last six month.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,现在还有人坚持自己看见了猫王Elvis呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,people still see Elvis all over the damn place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.76,0:09:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 两个蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,all I'm saying is douchewheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.18,0:09:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,才不什么专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't expert on crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.90,0:10:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.63,0:10:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我在查本地讣告通知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm checking the local deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.14,0:10:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,看有没有人有可能变成闹事的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if there's any candidates for ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,衣柜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.23,0:10:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Cassy的生命之光随日落而灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}The setting of the sunset of Cassy's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.29,0:10:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- Harry - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Harry - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.07,0:10:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你能不能别在facebook上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on,man,would you please stop facebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.56,0:10:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,视奸你前女友主页了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stalking your ex-girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.89,0:10:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,她把自己的感情状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}She changed her relationshop status to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.90,0:10:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,改成了 复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.41,0:10:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这个词到底是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that even mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.62,0:10:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,谁管什么意思 你跟她已经分手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares?You broke up with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.22,0:10:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,跟这姑娘有关的所有事情都很复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything about that girl is complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.67,0:10:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 她给自己买奶油泡芙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,I mean she gets a cream puff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.67,0:10:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,让你吃里面的奶油\N{\fnArial\fs30}She tells you to take the filling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.73,0:10:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,只是她的怪癖而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just puffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.35,0:10:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 真的挺怪异的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,that was some pretty messed up stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,uh-I'm-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.88,0:10:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay I'm good,back on game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.13,0:10:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们离末影人又近了一步 Ed\N{\fnArial\fs30}So close to finding Thinman,Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.94,0:11:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我能闻到它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can smell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.65,0:11:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,闻到它们特有的体味\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can smell its musk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.32,0:11:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,比以往更近一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,现在的情况很严峻 Harry\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is really serious,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.22,0:11:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Winchester兄弟都一路查到这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean the Winchesters are here and.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.83,0:11:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不想被Sam和Dean打断膝盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want my knees blown off by Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.69,0:11:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但你有没有想过 我们是不是应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever thought that we might just,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃这个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bail on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.69,0:11:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.93,0:11:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底 到底出什么毛病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the-what the hell is wrong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.60,0:11:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,决不能让那两个拖油瓶抢了我们的功劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't let those jockstraps steal our glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,别管他们怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't care what they think.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.81,0:11:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他们连twitter都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't even have a twitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.18,0:11:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能找到末影人的 Ed\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna find Thinman,Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.87,0:11:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,为了我们的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}For our families.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.77,0:11:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,为了Dana\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Dana.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.12,0:11:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 还能让你前女友大跌眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,so,it's about your ex eating her words.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.88,0:11:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,让所有不相信我们的人 都见鬼去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about making all the haters eat their words.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.99,0:11:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Maggie还有Spruce 背叛我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie and Spruce,the deserters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.58,0:11:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们想过他们的正常生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanna lead a normal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.25,0:11:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,照我说 那算什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,what is that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.25,0:11:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 见鬼去吧 - 见鬼去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Screw them - Screw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.87,0:11:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,等我们找到末影人\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we find Thinman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.10,0:11:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会成为我们的Phill医生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they gonna be our Dr.Phill.
