Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.78,0:18:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,录像带显示 Troy10分钟前刚锁上门\N{\fnArial\fs30}The footage shows Trey locked it ten minutes before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.72,0:18:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,锁 还是没锁 都无关紧要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked,not locked,it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.03,0:18:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都知道末影人会瞬移\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone knows Thinman can teleport.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.57,0:18:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我的EMF都没动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't even get a blip on my EMF.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.33,0:18:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,也许根本就不是个鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe it's not a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.47,0:18:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你们现在相信了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feds believers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.59,0:18:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,we gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.09,0:18:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,加油啊 副警长 探员们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good work,deputy,agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.60,0:18:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 Ed\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go,Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.27,0:18:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 能再看看吗 - 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See it again? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.41,0:18:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.56,0:18:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,有人把餐馆里有关末影人的视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone posted the dinner footage of Thinman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.36,0:18:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,发到了我们博客的评论区\N{\fnArial\fs30}In comments section of our blog.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.84,0:18:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,谁发的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.49,0:18:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,管他谁发的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.67,0:18:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,保持这个车速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maintain current velocity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.81,0:19:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry 你为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry,why.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.09,0:19:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要换上忍者夜行衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you putting your ninja outfit on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.19,0:19:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会坐以待毙看着其他人去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna wait for someone else to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.22,0:19:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我要找到末影人 就在今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna find Thinman tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.98,0:19:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,去哪儿找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.41,0:19:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,森林啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.87,0:19:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,多明显\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obvi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.83,0:19:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不 一点儿都不\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of general.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.25,0:19:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,民间传说记载\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well the lore says that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.43,0:19:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,末影人在树木周围出没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thinman hangs out by trees and.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.48,0:19:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,森林不就是有一堆树木出没的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the woods were trees hang out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.50,0:19:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,做掉一个镇子\N{\fnArial\fs30}To kill in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,埋伏在附近的森林再方便不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Local woods is the best bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.14,0:19:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,已经有两个人死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two people are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.05,0:19:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是真的死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.62,0:19:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直都在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I just keep thinking that you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.65,0:19:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,也许该让Sam和Dean插手就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Sam and Dean should just take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.33,0:19:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}First of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.64,0:19:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,绝不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.97,0:19:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,别在我的彩虹上下雨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And quit raining on my rainbow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.88,0:19:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不下雨是不可能有彩虹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rainbows can't happen without rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.52,0:19:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟我谈科学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't try to use science with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.04,0:19:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这是 感情上的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about...about a feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.71,0:19:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能在找到末影人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't quit when we're so close to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.24,0:19:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,关键时刻放弃 我们付出的努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finding Thinman and finally making up for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.04,0:19:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,和心血马上就要收到回报了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything we've lost because of...what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.60,0:19:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但是让专业人士来接管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,it wouldn't be the worst idea though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.24,0:19:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是最坏的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,if we leave it to the professionals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.67,0:19:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就是专业的 Ed\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the professionals,Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.20,0:19:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的打算去森林吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.43,0:20:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,任何森林 Ed 任何一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any woods,Ed,any woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,说一个不大靠谱的想法吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just grasping at straws here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.52,0:20:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,说到瞬间移动 我想到的是十字路口恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I think teleport,I think crossroads demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.82,0:20:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 恶魔喜欢捅别人 还看youtube\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh,demon likes to stab and watch youtube.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.47,0:20:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这又怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.73,0:20:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,说到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way,speaking of which.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.78,0:20:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Triel被刺的视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}The video of Triel getting knifed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.13,0:20:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,网上已经有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's already online.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.89,0:20:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,有2000多的关注度 就好像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has like two thousands views.It's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.42,0:20:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,有人想让大家看到末影人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone wants people to see Thinman in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.65,0:20:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,因为大家都会看 社会越来越变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause people will watch.'Cause people are sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.24,0:20:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候热门视频从\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when did viral go from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.50,0:20:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,大猩猩宝宝摔下树枝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby chimp falling out of a tree to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.01,0:20:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,变成嫌犯录影带了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killer Candid camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.57,0:20:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道什么视频会火吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what video would gone viral.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.17,0:20:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们还留着的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we still had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.36,0:20:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你五岁的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you are five.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.81,0:20:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,穿成蝙蝠侠的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got dressed up as batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.46,0:20:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,从屋顶跳下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you jumped off the shed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.51,0:20:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为你能飞起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause you thought you could fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.98,0:20:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是你先跳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you jumped first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.10,0:20:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我那时候九岁 扮的可是了超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I was nine and I was dressed up like superman,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.48,0:20:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都知道蝙蝠侠不能飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everybody knows batman can't fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.98,0:20:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道啊 就摔断了胳膊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know that and I broke my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.45,0:20:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yeah,you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.99,0:20:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我用推车把你从去了急诊室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I drove you to the ER on my handle bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.82,0:21:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,美好时光啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.26,0:21:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.52,0:21:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.63,0:21:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我得告诉你们一件重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta tell you guys something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.79,0:21:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,然后这案子就归你们管\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the case is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.03,0:21:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我是Harry 打鬼特工队个人行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry here,solo ghostfacer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.88,0:21:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,独自调查一处疑似末影人的藏身之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Investigate a possible Thinman habitat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.24,0:21:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,在森林深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.56,0:21:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,独自一人 探寻森林深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}All alone,deep in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.32,0:21:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人要知道自己即将面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man could lose him marbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.87,0:21:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,未知的恐怖时一定会吓疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being so close to the blade of doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.74,0:22:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,幸运的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.44,0:22:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们玩儿的就是疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really good at marbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.66,0:22:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你们怎么看待打鬼特工队\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,either you bleed Ghostfacers red.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.40,0:22:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是要告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.50,0:22:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Spruce想要离开去成立一个小公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Spruce wanted to start a startup.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.69,0:22:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Maggie一心扎进了场地轮滑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie's heart was in the roller derby.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.49,0:22:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有理由阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who am I gonna stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.92,0:22:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但是Harry 我不能让他被那女的看不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Harry,I couldn't let him give into his girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.05,0:22:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,她说打鬼特工队蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,she called ghostfacers stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.05,0:22:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,她说我们蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.45,0:22:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你们相信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.41,0:22:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,她爸爸手里的基金值多少钱我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care how much money her daddy's hedge fund has.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.74,0:22:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不能眼睁睁看着Harry\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just couldn't watch Harry become a.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.85,0:22:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,变得任人摆布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corporate stooge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.74,0:22:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,目前为止你说的都是个人恩怨情感纠纷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,this all sounds like sad times at Bitchmont High.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.51,0:22:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这些跟这个案子有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does this have to do with the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.66,0:22:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry那时候要走 所以我需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry was gonna leave so I needed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.15,0:22:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,给他一个留下的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him a reason to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.27,0:22:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,末影人是我编出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...I made up Thinman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.07,0:22:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,末影人跟踪被害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thinman stalks his victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.48,0:22:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但是现在情况恰恰相反 亲爱的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the tables have turned,my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.49,0:22:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,跟踪别人的 现在正被人跟踪着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stalker is now the stalkee.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.31,0:22:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说 这堆故事真的是扯淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you are saying this crap is actually crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.07,0:22:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,一张管家的老照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}One old photo of a butler.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.76,0:22:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,很多的后期制作\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of photoshop later and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.53,0:23:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,然后匿名发到一个恐怖论坛上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Posted it on one of those horror forum under anonymous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.86,0:23:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,然后就火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it blew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.20,0:23:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是 我只做了一个假案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I only faked one case for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.32,0:23:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都快回家的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we're packing up to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.29,0:23:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,有个人发了一个末影人的网址 然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When somebody posted a sighting of Thinman so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.42,0:23:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就去看了 然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}We went after it,that's how a Thinman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.79,0:23:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,末影人就变成人人皆知的传说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Became a crowdsourced legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.79,0:23:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎么 我们可是前锋\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could...We were at the front of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.57,0:23:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,整件事都有一种真实感\N{\fnArial\fs30}It felt like something.It.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.56,0:23:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,被人追捧着的感觉真是太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was so awesome to have a following.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.99,0:23:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry 他只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Harry,he's just.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.80,0:23:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,太投入了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's so into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.17,0:23:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed 你必须告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed,you have to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.27,0:23:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你不理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.22,0:23:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就是为了末影人而存在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were the Thinman guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.24,0:23:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,没有了末影人 我们只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without the Thinman,we're just.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.67,0:23:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys,just.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.92,0:23:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,满口空谈的妄想家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just puffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.45,0:23:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What - What.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.24,0:23:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我告诉Harry 他会离开打鬼特工队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I tell Harry,he's gonna leave the ghostfacers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.89,0:23:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不告诉他 他一样会离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen,if you don't tell him,he is gonna leave anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.71,0:23:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.16,0:23:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,秘密会毁坏任何一种关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secrets ruin relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.77,0:23:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 时机成熟我就告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,I'll just tell him when the time's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.60,0:23:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好现在就告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time's right now,Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.28,0:23:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 他啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,he's.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.62,0:24:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他不在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.36,0:24:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他去林子里找末影人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's out in the woods searching for Thinman.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.68,0:24:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 这个末影人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,because this Thinman.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.37,0:24:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,或者别的什么玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or whatever this hell this thing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.32,0:24:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,已经杀了两个人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has killed two people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.60,0:24:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,现在Harry又一个人在林子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now Harry is in the woods alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.48,0:24:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是几棵树而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,actually it's more like wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.32,0:24:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我把他送到便利店\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I dropped him off by some trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.13,0:24:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,后面的树旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind the grocery store.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.09,0:24:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,别急啊 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys,come on,he is gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.47,0:24:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.08,0:24:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在看到的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,what we have here is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.88,0:24:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,看似树枝状的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like a formation of sticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.88,0:24:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,堆成堆\N{\fnArial\fs30}In shape of a pile.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.84,0:24:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能是末影人留给我们的哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could've been left here for us by Thinman.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.44,0:24:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.03,0:24:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.83,0:24:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.17,0:24:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.92,0:24:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,周围还有别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.94,0:25:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,太紧了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.39,0:25:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.18,0:25:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉挺好 挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good,I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.29,0:25:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 等回去的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - I think I'm just gonna have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.75,0:25:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,钉住就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Staple it when we get back to the motal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.68,0:25:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是对的 Ed 末影人是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were right,Ed!Thinman is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.03,0:25:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.64,0:25:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,在那边发现了几条刚压过的车胎痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some fresh tire tracks back over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.50,0:25:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我照了几张相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took some photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.51,0:25:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What for.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.37,0:25:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,因为车主就是捅了你一刀的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that car might belong to whoever knifed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.47,0:25:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,给了我一刀的是末影人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever cut me was Thinman.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.67,0:25:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,末影人不开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Thinman doesn't drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.64,0:26:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,就是末影人干的 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Thinman,jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.12,0:26:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我真不该就这么告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have to connect the dots for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.85,0:26:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你们都是聪明人 也许是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured,you know,you're both intelegent-maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.67,0:26:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 Harry\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.13,0:26:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.74,0:26:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不早告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell me that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.37,0:26:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我 我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I don't know,I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.11,0:26:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我害怕你会生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.52,0:26:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,猜得不错 Ed 我是很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,good guess,Ed.I'm mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.28,0:26:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,对你非常 非常生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really,really mad at you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.99,0:26:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我能看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.16,0:26:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你毁了我人生中的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}You crashed the Jenga Tower of our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.88,0:26:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来是要结婚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.53,0:26:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我抛弃了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.75,0:26:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你生活在谎言里\N{\fnArial\fs30}To run around with you living in some lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.88,0:26:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,至少我们度过了一段美好的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least we're living it togerther.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.58,0:26:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.33,0:26:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你没开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.51,0:26:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我没造出末影人的谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I hadn't struck gold with Thinman.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.47,0:26:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在就应该做一份无聊的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be doing a boring job.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.68,0:26:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,跟无聊的数字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing boring numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.35,0:26:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,每天还要给Dana的爸爸汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}And answering to Dana's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.06,0:26:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你明不明白 我拯救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,I saved you,buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.27,0:26:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,把我从什么里拯救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save me from what.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.19,0:26:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,从美好的生活里\N{\fnArial\fs30}From living a nice life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.83,0:26:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,还是防止我被人捅上一刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}From not getting me stabbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.36,0:26:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是太自私了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How selfish can you be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.64,0:26:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,也许现在还不算太晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's not too late,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.98,0:26:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以给她打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could call her and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.40,0:26:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,没可能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.34,0:27:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,也许 还有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe...maybe it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.53,0:27:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不会的 想知道为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,it's not,you want to know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.33,0:27:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,因为她的肩上搭着另一个男人的手臂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause she's got some guy's arm wrapped around her neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.07,0:27:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,她的状态也变得复杂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's complicated,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.45,0:27:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 Harry 从一开始 我们也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,Harry,we didn't know from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.91,0:27:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,末影人到底是不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Thinman was real or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.82,0:27:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.05,0:27:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我承认我隐瞒了部分情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I had some inside knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.08,0:27:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但是如果我们一直为粉丝演下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But does it really make a different.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.38,0:27:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,真相是什么 还重要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we keep it going for the fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.28,0:27:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他们永远都不会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.08,0:27:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,但我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.36,0:27:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你把我骗的团团转\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made a chump out of me,Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.05,0:27:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我们能渡过这一关的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry,we can get throught this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.90,0:27:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只要除掉末影人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just debunk Thinman.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.31,0:27:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,然后继续我们的打鬼特工队\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we go back to Ghostfacers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.28,0:27:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.68,0:27:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法再相信你了 Ed\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't trust you anymore,Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.08,0:27:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样 Harry\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh come on Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.94,0:27:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂了 你是生气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it,you're pissed,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.29,0:27:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的这些都是气话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't mean what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.96,0:28:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry 告诉我你想怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Harry,just tell me what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.92,0:28:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我去买杯咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go get some coffee and.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.28,0:28:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这儿坐着缓缓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can stay here and chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.88,0:28:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,how did it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.53,0:28:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It went...um.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.44,0:28:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.49,0:28:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.12,0:28:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,刚被现实狠狠打了一拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got a punch right in the feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.78,0:29:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那些没有一个是真的 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of them was real,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.94,0:29:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed一直在装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed was just pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.52,0:29:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他还要我一起装\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now he wants me to pretend.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.83,0:29:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,装作这件事就可以过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like this is something I could get past.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.77,0:29:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白你的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.05,0:29:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,有些事情是你可以原谅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look there are things you can forgive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.50,0:29:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,有些不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there are things you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.39,0:29:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那这件事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So which one is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.50,0:29:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事要看你自己怎么想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's something you got to figure out for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.37,0:29:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.20,0:29:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我从轮胎痕迹上发现了一条线索 你要不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a bead on those tire treads,if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.20,0:29:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.30,0:29:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这种车胎只给一种车用\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the tires were only made for one kind of car.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.76,0:29:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,1989年的Geo Metro\N{\fnArial\fs30}The 1989 Geo Metro.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.80,0:29:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这个小镇 只有唯一一辆有注册\N{\fnArial\fs30}Town this small… There's only one registered here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.49,0:29:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,副警长说那是Roger的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Deputy says it belongs to a guy named Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.62,0:30:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他晚上在山下小镇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who works night security down at the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.25,0:30:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,北边当保安\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the north side of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.65,0:30:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这个会心灵传输的家伙 有工作还有车\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this thing teleported but it has a job and a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.56,0:30:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到底在对付什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.52,0:30:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧去查清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.51,0:30:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam和Dean有了新的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean caught something.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.38,0:30:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,现在去收拾你的烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...they are gonna clean up your mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.12,0:30:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你说得对 是我的烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right,it is my mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.67,0:30:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才是应该去清理的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be the one out there cleaning it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.23,0:30:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你只会让情况更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd just make it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.92,0:30:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh what.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.13,0:30:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你以前离开Sam和Dean的时候都没意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were fine leaving Sam and Dean before.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.61,0:30:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.29,0:30:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再当水母那样的软骨头了Harry\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want be a jellyfish spine anymore Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.70,0:30:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,水母没有骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jellyfish don't have spines.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.51,0:30:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.49,0:30:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,在遇到麻烦之前 在那些骗人的把戏之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the heartache,before the lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.40,0:30:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们说好了要帮助人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We set out to help people,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.42,0:30:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.55,0:30:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,大致是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.56,0:30:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们为什么不挺身而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there is no reason not to get out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.47,0:30:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,做我们说好要做的事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do what we mostly set out to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.67,0:31:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry我可以让我们一切恢复正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry,I can make it right for the both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.92,0:31:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以让一切恢复正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.88,0:31:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.05,0:31:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你要和我一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.51,0:31:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是说过 我和我搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we said that my partner and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.57,0:31:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,会处理好这件事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.31,0:31:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,听着哥们 我上司跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look guys,my boss is AWOL.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.54,0:31:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也没有搜查证\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have a warrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.02,0:31:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这事儿搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ass is on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.20,0:31:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我肯定完蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this thing goes to the sideways.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.63,0:31:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧你就 靠后站\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right just...stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.63,0:32:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,一直想试试这玩意儿来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always wanted to use these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.41,0:32:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你是末影人是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're Thinman.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.50,0:32:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不是一副吃翔吃太多的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would make sense if it didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.54,0:32:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,确实还挺可信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look like you just ate a fat camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.56,0:32:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐Sam 快让他闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god,Sam make him stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.90,0:32:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧到底是怎么回事 你到底是谁 Norwood\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,so what's the deal?What are you,Norwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.99,0:32:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你是恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.63,0:32:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你在餐馆是怎么瞬间移动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean how did you teleport back at the diner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.41,0:32:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,团队合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Team effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.03,0:33:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,所以压根就没有什么瞬间移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there was no teleporting.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.94,0:33:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,就是两个傻叉重演惊声尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a couple of douche bags doing a scream thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.09,0:33:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,等下 我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait,I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.34,0:33:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你是小餐馆的打工仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the busboy from the diner.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.60,0:33:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是看你老板不爽杀他的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what,you just wanted to kill your boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.49,0:33:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Trey是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trey was a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.43,0:33:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那Cassy呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about Cassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.89,0:33:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,她又做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did she do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.89,0:33:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,她不愿意跟我约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wouldn't go out with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.47,0:33:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我就把她介绍给别人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I set her up with someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.50,0:33:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我的刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}My knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.93,0:33:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你太逗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good one,Rog.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.56,0:33:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,看来警长也没能出城\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the sherrif didn't make it out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.53,0:33:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他当时要是给我准假就没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He really should've given me the time off I asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.69,0:33:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你就杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.17,0:33:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我谁也没杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't kill anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.94,0:33:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,都是Roger杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger did.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.53,0:33:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个小疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a psycho.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.10,0:33:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个空想家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the visionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.83,0:33:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我不怪你们看低我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't blame you for underestimating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.86,0:33:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everbody does.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.83,0:34:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,光鲜的联邦探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fancy fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.17,0:34:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,从来这儿的那一刻起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in here and treating me like.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.55,0:34:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,就把我当猴儿耍\N{\fnArial\fs30}A paper monkey from the get-go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.67,0:34:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我才是末影人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was Thinman the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.65,0:34:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道那种感觉有多爽吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea how good that felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.71,0:34:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不 变态 我体会不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sicko,I can't say that I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.13,0:34:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,长得这么俊怎么会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah pretty boy doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.03,0:34:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,被人忽视是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What it's like to feel invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.30,0:34:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,在一个300人的小镇里 长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}To grow up in a town of 300 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.15,0:34:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但从没有人看你一眼又是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nobody sees you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.71,0:34:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他们根本不会注意我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.34,0:34:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 你们是怎么认识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So How did you two meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.45,0:34:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,互撸网吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wackjob.com.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.78,0:34:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.03,0:34:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是在一个没人的酒吧里随便聊了两句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a couple of schmoes in an empty bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.90,0:34:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,一见如故 没想到我和Roge\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hit it off,turns out me and Roge.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.41,0:34:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都是阴谋论的终极爱好者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are both total conspiracy-theory junkies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.51,0:34:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,之后我们就发现了末影人 然后 砰\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we found Thinman,and,bam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.36,0:34:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们攻击了许多留言版块\N{\fnArial\fs30}We blew up all over the message boards.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.44,0:34:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那你们现在是在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what is this then.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.99,0:34:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,变态角色扮演吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some sort of a twisted cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.45,0:34:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是真人扮演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cos-real.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.15,0:34:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,博客是挺有意思的 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,blogging was fun but.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.77,0:34:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,让我猜猜 但是你们还想得寸进尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}But,let me guess,you wanted something more.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.38,0:34:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道 你们干的这些混账事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realize what you two jackasses are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.43,0:35:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,并没让你们变成末影人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't make you Thinman.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.93,0:35:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你们只是两个冒牌货\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes you copycat killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.02,0:35:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是末影人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes me Thinman.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.83,0:35:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会跟别人说我不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not telling anyone I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.26,0:35:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,因为死人是不会说话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause you'll be too dead to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.51,0:35:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好戏开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.18,0:35:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个真走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are lucky ducks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.83,0:35:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,有机会在我们最好的视频里做主角\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the stars of our best video yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.53,0:35:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这段视频会传遍天下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want it goes viral.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.87,0:35:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都会知道末影人是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyon will know Thinman is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.07,0:35:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 开拍\N{\fnArial\fs30}And action.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.12,0:35:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no,don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.43,0:35:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.58,0:36:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他在我这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.77,0:36:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他抓到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.50,0:36:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,大坏蛋要哭鼻子了 蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's scooby-doo time,doushbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.93,0:36:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的面具拿下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take off the mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.46,0:36:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你不是末影人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you are not Thinman.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.19,0:36:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是个冒片卑货\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are just a me-me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.34,0:36:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,念冒牌货\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it prononces me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.55,0:36:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但是写成片卑啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It spells m e m e,though.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.50,0:36:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那是一个字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the second is silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.53,0:36:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个冒片卑货 冒片货\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a meme...a man meme.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.45,0:36:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我创造出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I invented you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.93,0:36:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢赐教\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.04,0:36:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢那些经典的著作 Ed\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a lover of the classics,Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.93,0:36:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在面对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what we have here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.78,0:36:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是一个典型的Frankenstein局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is a "Frankenstein" situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.49,0:36:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 哇靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean WOW.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.16,0:36:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的创造者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The creator.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.84,0:36:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们本来想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean we were gonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.65,0:37:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,让你们中一个活着给我们讲故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let one of you guys live to tell us the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.27,0:37:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不过现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.60,0:37:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,等你们俩一死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you two are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.10,0:37:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,就没有人能证明末影人只是你们想象出来的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be no proof that Thinman was your brainchild.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.82,0:37:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!No no no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.96,0:37:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.16,0:37:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这全都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all my fault,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.59,0:37:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.34,0:37:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我的子弹够杀你们俩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got enough bullets for both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.77,0:38:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这事儿算是解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we are good in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.69,0:38:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.96,0:38:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,有了末影人录影带 再加上我布置过的现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the Thinman footage and the way I set the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.40,0:38:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,应该有足够的证据可以指出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should be enough breadcrumbs to make it look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.37,0:38:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是那两个神经病解决了对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those two psychos offed each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.50,0:38:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他们只是普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were just people,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.65,0:38:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不是恶魔也不是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They weren't demons,they weren't monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.10,0:38:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,只是人类而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just fricking people.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.21,0:38:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过了 人类都不正常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well like I said,people are sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.37,0:38:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们和好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,are we cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.97,0:38:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们永远都不会好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we ever will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.92,0:38:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把事情解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know we made it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.47,0:39:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们打赢了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We beat the guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.69,0:39:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以试着重新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will be our shot to start the old.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.90,0:39:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,打鬼特工队的旅程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghostfacers again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.28,0:39:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是来和你一起解决末影人的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came here with you to finish this thing with Thinman.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.33,0:39:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这不仅仅是一个章节的完结 Ed\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't just...closing a chapter,Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.58,0:39:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是一整本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the whole dang book.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.79,0:39:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚刚救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.33,0:39:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我杀了一个人 Ed\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed a guy,Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.77,0:39:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那是个坏人Harry\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a bad guy,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.63,0:39:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那是一条人命 Ed\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a guy,Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.31,0:39:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就因为你那破玩意太多人死掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many people have died cause of your crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.80,0:39:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我做这些是为了我们两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done all this crap for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.32,0:39:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白你怎么就是不懂呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't know why you don't see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.01,0:39:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.36,0:39:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你做那些只是为了你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.11,0:39:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经够宽容了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot things I can forgive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.01,0:39:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这件事我无法释怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this isn't one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.74,0:39:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们两个之间是怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what does this mean about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.90,0:39:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.98,0:39:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,一言难尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.13,0:40:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以搭个顺风车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get a ride from you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.93,0:40:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可以 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.36,0:40:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry,you okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.54,0:40:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.71,0:41:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 不怎么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean...no.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.40,0:41:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟一个人在一起那么多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}You roll with a guy so many years you start to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.13,0:41:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你相信他永远都会守在你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's always gonna be next to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.68,0:41:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕年华渐逝 只能凭栏望景\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like when you're old and you're drinking on the porch.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.48,0:41:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个人能与你相濡以沫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be in that nother rocking chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.35,0:41:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,直到世事更迭你才发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And something happens and you realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.88,0:41:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,相濡以沫 不如相忘于江湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}That other chair's gone,empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.84,0:41:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你能明白我的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I mean
